      "widgets_values": [
        "masterpiece, best quality, score_7, highres, safe, @blade \\(galaxist\\), 1girl, solo, cat girl, cat ears, brown hair, bob cut, fluffy hair, bangs, sidelocks, portrait, close-up, headshot, head tilt, cute, maid, maid headdress, black dress, white collar, frills, pink ribbon, light pink background, simple background, floating petals, pastel colors, delicate lineart, soft shading, closed eyes, :3, blush.\n\nA cute anime catgirl avatar in a square close-up portrait. She has fluffy chocolate-brown bobbed hair and two furry brown cat ears with pale pink interiors. A small white frilled maid headband sits between the ears, with one small pastel pink bow. She wears a classic black-and-white maid dress: a high white frilled collar, a little rose-pink ribbon at her throat, and white shoulder frills. Only her neck and the tops of her shoulders appear at the lower edge. Her large face occupies most of the picture; the entire head and both cat ears fit inside the frame with a very small margin above. Slight three-quarter turn and a gentle head tilt, rounded cheeks and delicate facial features. Both eyes are completely closed in soft smiling arcs; her small mouth makes a sweet catlike smile.\n\nFine clean anime linework, carefully drawn hair locks, soft cel coloring, subtly luminous brown hair highlights. Dusty rose, blush pink, chocolate brown, black and ivory palette. A quiet pale pink background with a few tiny drifting cherry-blossom petal shapes. Minimal accessories. Polished, cute, expressive, fully dressed."
      ]
